AUDIO: 'Octane search can connect directly to the model. On the control panel, you can see different models, including GPT 5.4 , GPT 5.6 Luna, GPT 5.6 Terra, GPT 5.6 Sol, and others. With the'

[03:49] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'free plan, you get access to a limited number of these models. I\'ll pick one model, turn on broad search as a tool, and ask, "What were the biggest AI investments this week?" If the model needs fresh data'

[04:01] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'for an answer, it turns to search and supplements the answer with relevant web information. So , I can change the model without having to rewrite the entire search backend of my application from scratch. For broader'

